UID:try-hockey-free-20261003@paulsnider.net
DTSTAMP:20260903T033055Z
SUMMARY:Try Hockey for Free - Will\, Max
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261003T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261003T160000
DESCRIPTION:Ages 4+. Cost: FREE\; registration required. Bring a helmet
  (bike helmet works fine)\, warm winter pants and jacket\, and winter
  gloves. Skates and hockey sticks are provided. Each registered player
  receives a free arcade card good for one hour of non-redemption games\;
  pick it up at check-in. The card may be used on a different date\, but
  its 60-minute timer starts when first swiped.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-IMPORT-TYPE:MANUAL
END:VEVENT
